# Google Sign-In and Google Forms import (optional).
# 1. Create a Web application OAuth 2.0 Client ID at https://console.cloud.google.com/
#    APIs & Services → Credentials → Create Credentials → OAuth client ID → Web application.
# 2. Add your app origin to "Authorized JavaScript origins" (required for the button to work):
#    - Development: http://localhost:5173 (or the port Vite uses)
#    - Production: https://yourdomain.com
# 3. Copy this file to .env and set your real client ID. Restart the dev server after changing .env.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
